# Build context of Dockerfile and Dockerfile.prebuilt (compose builds with context "."). Only what
# the two Dockerfiles copy is sent; everything else, including target/ apart from the four release
# binaries, .flow-gate/, uploads, generated configuration with secrets and .env, stays out.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!apps/**
!crates/**
!migrations/**
!spikes/collab-shared/**
!spikes/collab-loro/**
!spikes/collab-yrs-yjs/**
!target/release/api
!target/release/worker
!target/release/mcp-server
!target/release/sylvode
**/node_modules
**/target/debug
